<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<title>Ferry: third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  ul.used-by { columns: 16rem; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 13px; padding: 0.75rem; border: 1px solid #8884; border-radius: 6px; }
  a { color: #2f6fdf; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>Ferry is built on the open source software below. Each license is shown
once, followed by the software it covers.</p>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
  <li><a href="#lucide">Lucide icons</a></li>
</ul>
{{!-- Written by hand: iced_fonts embeds the Lucide font, whose license
isn't in the crate's metadata. From
https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/main/LICENSE --}}
